! Negative-test mechanism: PLOG with a DUPLICATE pressure node.
! strict_chemkin dialect (SpeedCHEM default) forbids two PLOG lines at
! the same pressure within one reaction; CKINTP must reject this with a
! non-zero exit (error stop), not link it. See README.md.
ELEMENTS
H O N
END
SPECIES
H2 O2 H2O H O OH HO2 H2O2 N2
END
REACTIONS
O + H2  = OH + H         5.060E+04   2.67    6290.0
H + O2 = HO2             1.000E+12   0.00     500.0
    PLOG /  1.0   1.000E+12   0.00     500.0 /
    PLOG /  1.0   2.000E+12   0.00     600.0 /
END
